Looking for an audiovisual equipment rental service in Malaga? If you searched that exact phrase, you likely already found our [audio visual rental](/blog/audio-visual-rental/) page, since the two terms describe the same core service. This page exists for a narrower reason: to lay out the specialized and niche layer of our catalog, the 5000 lumen laser projector tier, RGBW spotlights, specialty stage lighting and uplighting, wireless and gooseneck microphone systems, the 60 inch LED display, and fog, haze and confetti effects, in one place, and to say plainly what falls outside it.

Malaga Event Gear (MEG) delivers, installs and tests every piece of this equipment ourselves, across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol, backed by experience going back to 1996. Nothing below is a wishlist. Every item is either a real package inclusion with a published euro price, or an honest "not in our catalog."

## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear supplies the specialized and niche end of its audiovisual catalog, the laser projector tier, RGBW spotlights, specialty stage lighting and uplighting, wireless and gooseneck microphone systems, the 60 inch LED display and special effects equipment, for corporate events, product launches and celebrations across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol.

This page indexes that layer and cross links to our dedicated [sound system](/blog/sound-system-rental/), [TV screen](/blog/tv-screen-rental/) and [projector](/blog/projector-rental/) guides for the full pricing and package detail on each product. [Contact us](/contact/) to match a package to your event.

## Key Highlights

---

-   One real laser tier: a 5000 lumen Full HD laser projector on the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/), the brightest projector we publish.

-   Shure wireless microphones and professional gooseneck lecterns, deployed across the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/), [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/), per our own equipment catalog.

-   RGBW LED spotlights on the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/), plus a compact multi head LED light bar and a Fresnel zoom wash light listed in our lighting inventory for larger corporate and specialty setups.

-   A wireless, battery powered uplighting kit (6 fixtures), a separate item from our spotlights, for washing a wall or structure with color from the floor.

-   Low lying fog machines, hazers and confetti cannons in our special effects inventory, with the smoke/fog machine published as a 20 euro Eco Pack add on.

-   A blunt "What We Don't Offer" list further down, so you know before you call whether interpretation equipment, video walls or backdrops are in scope.

## Why This Page Exists: Specialized Equipment vs. Our Core AV Packages

Search "audiovisual equipment rental service" and you land on the same intent as "audio visual rental." We don't pretend otherwise. Our [audio visual rental](/blog/audio-visual-rental/) pillar covers the core event packages, from the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) up to the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/), and is the right starting point if you just need sound, a screen and lighting for a wedding or a conference.

This page covers a different question: which pieces of our inventory sit at the specialized or niche end, the laser tier rather than the standard projector, a multi head light bar or an uplighting kit rather than a plain spotlight, a fog machine or confetti cannon rather than a basic light bar, and what genuinely falls outside our catalog even though a general search for AV rental in Malaga turns it up on a competitor's page. If you already know you need a wedding sound system or a conference screen, our [sound system rental](/blog/sound-system-rental/) and [TV screen rental](/blog/tv-screen-rental/) guides answer that directly. If you're trying to work out whether we stock the more specialized layer, or whether something like interpretation equipment or a video wall is even possible with us, keep reading.

<InlineCTA />

## The 5000 Lumen Laser Projector Tier

Our brightest projector is a 5000 lumen Full HD laser unit, bundled with a front projection screen on a stable stand on the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/), for 310 euros ex VAT. It's built for a room that stays lit, a dealership showroom during a launch or a press event where photographers need working light, rather than a darkened conference hall.

We deployed that exact tier for a two day corporate project with [Bmotion in Benahavis](/blog/news-malaga-event-gear-delivers-flawless-audiovisual-production-for-bmotion-in-benahavis/), where the laser projector kept imagery bright and sharp under the venue's own ambient corporate lighting. For the full lumens comparison against our standard 3000 lumen tier, and for what we don't offer on the projection side, see our [projector rental](/blog/projector-rental/) guide.

## RGBW Spotlights, Specialty Stage Lighting and Uplighting

Three real products sit under lighting. The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) includes 2 light bars with RGBW LED spotlights, a color changing accent fixture you run yourself, published at 290 euros ex VAT for up to 50 guests. Our equipment catalog also lists a compact 4 head LED light bar with foot pedal control, and a Fresnel zoom wash light, alongside those spotlights, for larger corporate stages and specialty setups. We don't publish a fixed package line or a standalone price for either fixture the way we do for the Eco Pack's light bars: [contact us](/contact/) with your event's scale and we'll confirm what's possible.

Uplighting is a separate item from all of the above: a wireless, battery powered uplighting kit of 6 fixtures, for washing a wall or structure with color from the floor rather than spotlighting a fixed point. It is not bundled into any package and has no published a la carte price, so [contact us](/contact/) with your venue and guest count for a quote. See our [stage uplighting](/blog/stage-uplighting/) guide for honest venue coverage and a full comparison against these RGBW spotlights. For wedding specific lighting, including our fairy light strings on the Wedding Pack, see our [lighting ideas for wedding rentals](/blog/lighting-ideas-for-wedding-rentals/) guide.

## Wireless and Gooseneck Microphone Systems

Our microphone inventory runs on Shure wireless systems, paired with professional gooseneck lecterns for podium speeches. The exact mix depends on the package: a gooseneck microphone on the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/), wireless handheld microphones on the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/), and both a gooseneck plus a wireless handheld microphone on the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/). We also stock wireless lavalier and headset microphones as a separate item from the package inclusions above, not bundled into a fixed package line: [contact us](/contact/) if your event needs a hands free mic for a presenter or performer. See our [headset and lavalier microphone rental](/blog/headset-lavalier-microphone-rental/) guide for the full lavalier versus headset comparison and honest pricing, and our [sound system rental](/blog/sound-system-rental/) guide for the full package by package breakdown, technician hours and euro pricing.

## The 60 Inch LED Display

The one large format display we publish is a premium 60 inch high definition LED display screen with a designer stand, included on the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) at 490 euros ex VAT for up to 120 guests. It's a self lit panel, not a projected image, so it stays legible in a bright lobby, an exhibition stand or a gala dinner room. Full pricing, sizing and the "is this the same as a plasma screen" answer live on our [TV screen rental](/blog/tv-screen-rental/) guide.

## Special Effects: Fog, Haze and Confetti

Our equipment catalog lists low lying fog machines for a cloud effect at weddings, hazers to enhance light beams, and professional confetti cannons under special effects. Of these, only the professional smoke/fog machine carries a published a la carte price, a 20 euro add on to the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/). Hazers and confetti cannons are part of our real inventory, but we don't publish a standalone price for them the way we do for the fog machine, so contact us with your event details for a quote.

We supplied confetti and lighting effects for the awards ceremony of the Billie Jean King Cup 2024, one of the larger celebration setups in our own gallery.

![Spectacular celebration at the Billie Jean King Cup 2024 with confetti and professional lights and sound system.](https://cdn.malagaeventgear.com/blog/1192/billie-jean-king-cup-2024-celebration-lights-sound-600x450.avif)

The Billie Jean King Cup 2024 celebration, with confetti and lighting effects deployed alongside our sound system. See our [audio visual rental for sports events](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-sports-events/) guide for the full setup.

## Modular Staging for Corporate Events

Staging is a real, priced add on, not a freestanding truss or drape system. The [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) offers modular stage platforms at 35 euros per square meter, sized to your room rather than sold as a fixed unit. We deployed exactly this for a two day corporate project with [Bmotion in Marbella](/blog/news-malaga-event-gear-delivers-premium-technical-support-for-bmotions-high-profile-corporate-project-in-marbella/), where modular platforms and staging structures created the elevated presentation area international corporate clients expected.

We do not stock truss as a separate rental item, and we do not supply pipe and drape or backdrop hardware. See [What We Don't Offer](#what-we-dont-offer) below.

## What We Don't Offer

A general search for AV equipment rental in Malaga turns up services from other local providers that are not part of our catalog. Rather than stay quiet about it, here is the honest list, each one already stated on a live page of ours:

-   **Simultaneous interpretation or translation equipment.** We do not stock this equipment ourselves. Real demand exists locally for it, so we can arrange it for your event through a subcontracted partner rather than turn the request away: [contact us](/contact/) with your language pairs and guest count.

-   **Video walls, LED walls or projection mapping.** Our large format display is a single 60 inch flat panel, not a modular tiled video wall, and our projector setups don't include facade projection or outdoor mapping. See our [TV screen rental](/blog/tv-screen-rental/) and [projector rental](/blog/projector-rental/) guides.

-   **Interactive voting or audience response systems.** We do not stock this equipment ourselves, but we can arrange it for a congress or corporate event through a subcontracted partner, the same as our simultaneous interpretation service above: [contact us](/contact/) with your requirements.

-   **Walkie talkies, silent disco equipment, camera cranes, tripods or laptop rental.** None of these appear anywhere in our packages or equipment catalog. We won't invent a quote for a product we don't stock.

-   **Pipe and drape or event backdrops.** We are not a decor provider. Our [unique wedding ceremony rentals](/blog/unique-wedding-ceremony-rentals/) guide is explicit: no arch, no backdrop, no draping, no furniture. Our [audio visual rental for press conferences](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-press-conferences/) guide says the same for a branded backdrop or step-and-repeat banner, usually sourced through your PR or marketing team instead.

