## How Far in Advance to Book

Book as early as you can once your event date is confirmed. Demand on the Costa del Sol peaks during wedding season, from April through October, when technicians and the most requested packages fill up first. Corporate bookings that need the laser projector tier, the 60 inch display or modular staging should lock in the package early rather than wait for a final headcount, since these sit on our higher demand corporate packages.

## Conclusion

An audiovisual equipment rental service search and an audio visual rental search point at the same catalog. What differs here is the layer: the 5000 lumen laser projector, Shure wireless and gooseneck microphones, RGBW spotlights, specialty stage lighting and uplighting, the 60 inch LED display, and fog, haze and confetti effects, alongside a direct answer on what we don't stock. [Contact us](/contact/) to match a package to your event. For the full package range and pricing, see our [audio visual rental](/blog/audio-visual-rental/) page.

## FAQs

### What Is the Difference Between This Page and Your General Audio Visual Rental Page?

They describe the same core service. Our [audio visual rental](/blog/audio-visual-rental/) page covers the full package range, from the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) up to the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/). This page indexes the specialized and niche equipment layer inside that same catalog, the laser projector tier, RGBW spotlights, specialty stage lighting and uplighting, wireless and gooseneck microphones, the 60 inch LED display and special effects, plus an honest list of what falls outside our catalog. See [Why This Page Exists](#why-this-page-exists-specialized-equipment-vs-our-core-av-packages) above.

### Do You Rent a Mixing Console or Audio Mixer on Its Own?

No. Our digital mixing consoles are technician operated equipment built into the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/), [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/), not a standalone rental item. See our [sound system rental](/blog/sound-system-rental/) guide for the full detail.

### Do You Offer Headset or Lavalier Microphones?

Yes. We stock wireless lavalier and headset microphones as a separate item from our package inclusions, for a presenter or performer who needs a hands free mic. See [Wireless and Gooseneck Microphone Systems](#wireless-and-gooseneck-microphone-systems) above, and our [headset and lavalier microphone rental](/blog/headset-lavalier-microphone-rental/) guide for the full comparison and pricing.

### Do You Provide Simultaneous Interpretation or Translation Equipment?

Not from our own equipment catalog, but yes as an arranged service: we don't stock interpretation hardware ourselves, so we bring in a subcontracted partner to cover it rather than turn the request away. [Contact us](/contact/) with your language pairs and guest count.

### What Is Uplighting and Do You Rent It?

Uplighting sits on the floor and washes light upward against a wall or structure. Yes, we rent it: a wireless, battery powered uplighting kit of 6 fixtures, a separate item from the [Eco Pack's](/packages/eco/) RGBW light bars, which spotlight and color a room from a fixed position rather than washing a wall from the floor. [Contact us](/contact/) with your venue and guest count for a quote. See our [stage uplighting](/blog/stage-uplighting/) guide for honest venue coverage, or our [lighting ideas for wedding rentals](/blog/lighting-ideas-for-wedding-rentals/) guide for the full wedding picture.

### Do You Rent a Video Wall or LED Wall?

No. Our large format display is a single 60 inch flat panel screen on a designer stand, not a modular tiled video wall built from stacked LED cabinets. See our [TV screen rental](/blog/tv-screen-rental/) guide for what we publish instead.

### Can I Rent a Projection Screen Without a Projector, or Vice Versa?

No. We do not sell a projection screen on its own, and we do not rent a projector without one. Every screen we deploy is bundled with a projector sized to it, whether that's the Eco Pack's 50 euro add on or the fixed screen and projector inclusion on the Basic MICE Pack and Product Presentation Pack. See our [projector rental](/blog/projector-rental/) guide for the full breakdown.

### Do You Provide Interactive Voting or Audience Response Systems?

Not from our own equipment catalog, but yes as an arranged service: clicker devices, live polling hardware and interactive voting systems aren't something we stock ourselves, so we bring in a subcontracted partner to cover them for a congress or corporate event. [Contact us](/contact/) with your requirements.

### What Laser or Special Lighting Effects Do You Offer?

Our brightest projector is a 5000 lumen Full HD laser unit on the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/). On the effects side, our catalog lists low lying fog machines for a cloud effect, hazers to enhance light beams, and professional confetti cannons, with the fog machine published as a 20 euro Eco Pack add on. We do not offer laser light shows, gobo or monogram projection, or hologram displays. See [Special Effects](#special-effects-fog-haze-and-confetti) above.

### Do You Rent Staging, Truss or Pipe and Drape?

Staging, yes, as a priced add on: modular stage platforms at 35 euros per square meter on the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/). Truss, no, we don't stock it as a separate rental item. Pipe and drape or event backdrops, also no: we are not a decor provider, and that's stated directly on our [unique wedding ceremony rentals](/blog/unique-wedding-ceremony-rentals/) guide. See [Modular Staging for Corporate Events](#modular-staging-for-corporate-events) above.
